  << /ActualText (I\031m applying for the Technical Lead Product Designer \023 Crypto role with a clear focus\072 building crypto experiences that actually work for real people at scale\056\nI bring 12\053 years in product design and a strong specialization in Web3\056 At gg\056xyz\054 I led the end\055to\055end design of a crypto\055native platform\054 creating token dashboards\054 reward systems\054 and onboarding flows designed to reduce friction for non\055crypto users\056 My work focused on turning complex mechanics into intuitive\054 trust\055driven experiences\054 something essential for mass adoption\056\nI\031m also hands\055on with the ecosystem\056 I won the EthereumSP Hackathon \0502022\051\054 where I built a Web3 product prototype under real constraints\054 which sharpened both my technical understanding and product thinking in blockchain environments\056\nBeyond execution\054 I operate as a design lead\056 I\031ve built scalable design systems\054 worked closely with engineers and founders\054 and helped define product direction in fast\055moving environments\056 I\031m comfortable owning ambiguity\054 making decisions\054 and pushing for clarity between business goals and user needs\056\nWhat excites me about Nubank is the scale and responsibility\056 You\031re not just building features\054 you\031re shaping how millions of people in Latin America will interact with crypto\056 That requires clarity\054 trust\054 and strong product thinking\054 which is exactly where I operate best\056\n\nPortfolio\072 )
